{
  "name": "Extratos · Entrada WhatsApp",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "sticky-45",
      "name": "Nota whatsapp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -620,
        -60
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Entrada 3 · WhatsApp\n\nEscrito para a **Evolution API** (`messages.upsert` → webhook).\nSe você usar a Meta Cloud API ou a Z-API, só os dois nós marcados mudam:\n**Webhook · WhatsApp** (formato do evento) e\n**Baixar mídia (Evolution)** (como obter o binário).\nDo nó *Montar contexto* em diante o fluxo é idêntico ao do Telegram.\n\n### Env vars\n```\nEVOLUTION_API_URL       http://evolution:8080\nEVOLUTION_INSTANCE      fintech\nEVOLUTION_API_KEY       apikey da instância\n```\n\n⚠️ `organizacao/ideias-regras-de-negocio.md:80` — canal externo só\npode responder com `ConsentimentoLgpd` ativo. A checagem vive no\nendpoint `/usuarios/whatsapp/{numero}`, que deve devolver 404/403\nquando não houver consentimento.",
        "height": 560,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "webhook-46",
      "name": "Webhook · WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -120,
        300
      ],
      "webhookId": "fintech-extratos-whatsapp",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "extratos/whatsapp",
        "responseMode": "lastNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "if-47",
      "name": "Tem mídia?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        100,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-48",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.body.event === 'messages.upsert' && !$json.body.data?.key?.fromMe && (!!$json.body.data?.message?.documentMessage || !!$json.body.data?.message?.imageMessage || !!$json.body.data?.message?.documentWithCaptionMessage) }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-49",
      "name": "Baixar mídia (Evolution)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        340,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_URL }}/chat/getBase64FromMediaMessage/{{ $env.EVOLUTION_INSTANCE }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "json",
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ message: { key: $json.body.data.key }, convertToMp4: false }) }}"
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000
    },
    {
      "id": "http-50",
      "name": "Resolver usuário pelo número",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        560,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "timeout": 10000
        },
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.FINTECH_API_URL || 'http://backend:8080' }}/usuarios/whatsapp/{{ $('Webhook · WhatsApp').first().json.body.data.key.remoteJid.split('@')[0] }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Internal-Api-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "code-51",
      "name": "Montar contexto",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        780,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Normaliza o payload da Evolution API e junta com o usuario resolvido no backend.\nconst evt = $('Webhook · WhatsApp').first().json.body || {};\nconst midia = $('Baixar mídia (Evolution)').first().json;\nconst u = $input.first().json;\n\nconst m = evt.data?.message || {};\nconst doc = m.documentMessage || m.documentWithCaptionMessage?.message?.documentMessage || null;\nconst img = m.imageMessage || null;\n\nconst remoteJid = evt.data?.key?.remoteJid || '';\nconst numero = remoteJid.split('@')[0];\n\nif (!u.id && !u.usuarioId) {\n  throw new Error('Backend nao retornou usuario para o numero ' + numero);\n}\n\nconst base64 = String(midia.base64 || midia.data || '').replace(/^data:[^;]+;base64,/, '');\nif (!base64) throw new Error('Evolution API nao devolveu o base64 da midia.');\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  remoteJid,\n  numero,\n  usuarioId: u.usuarioId ?? u.id,\n  contaId: u.contaPadraoId ?? u.contaId ?? null,\n  arquivoNome: doc?.fileName || ('extrato-' + Date.now() + (img ? '.jpg' : '.pdf')),\n  mimeType: doc?.mimetype || img?.mimetype || 'application/pdf',\n  arquivoBase64: base64\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "tobin-52",
      "name": "base64 → binário",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.convertToFile",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "toBinary",
        "sourceProperty": "arquivoBase64",
        "options": {
          "fileName": "={{ $json.arquivoNome }}",
          "mimeType": "={{ $json.mimeType }}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-53",
      "name": "Registrar extrato (dedup)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1220,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.FINTECH_API_URL || 'http://backend:8080' }}/extratos/upload",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "usuarioId",
              "value": "={{ $json.usuarioId }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "contaId",
              "value": "={{ $json.contaId }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "assincrono",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Internal-Api-Key",
              "value": "={{ $env.INTERNAL_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "arquivo",
              "inputDataFieldName": "data"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "exec-54",
      "name": "Executar core IA",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "COLE_AQUI_O_ID_DO_WORKFLOW_CORE",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "workflowInputs": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "extratoId": "={{ $json.id }}",
            "extratoCode": "={{ $json.code }}",
            "usuarioId": "={{ $json.usuarioId }}",
            "contaId": "={{ $json.contaId }}",
            "arquivoNome": "={{ $('Montar contexto').first().json.arquivoNome }}",
            "mimeType": "={{ $('Montar contexto').first().json.mimeType }}",
            "arquivoBase64": "={{ $('Montar contexto').first().json.arquivoBase64 }}",
            "origem": "whatsapp",
            "canalRetorno": "whatsapp",
            "chatIdRetorno": "={{ $('Montar contexto').first().json.remoteJid }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "extratoId",
              "displayName": "extratoId",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "extratoCode",
              "displayName": "extratoCode",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "usuarioId",
              "displayName": "usuarioId",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "contaId",
              "displayName": "contaId",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "arquivoNome",
              "displayName": "arquivoNome",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "mimeType",
              "displayName": "mimeType",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "arquivoBase64",
              "displayName": "arquivoBase64",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "origem",
              "displayName": "origem",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "canalRetorno",
              "displayName": "canalRetorno",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "chatIdRetorno",
              "displayName": "chatIdRetorno",
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "display": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "type": "string"
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": true,
          "convertFieldsToString": false
        },
        "options": {
          "waitForSubWorkflow": true
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "http-55",
      "name": "WhatsApp · resultado",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1700,
        180
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        },
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_URL }}/message/sendText/{{ $env.EVOLUTION_INSTANCE }}",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $env.EVOLUTION_API_KEY }}"
